{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55121","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"他军走（京本作「是」），虚实（辛本、川本、京本作「的」）好参陈。\n神克日辰天马并，传扬定去必无人，此兆决然真。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}